      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        141.81719970703125,
        526.984619140625,
        154.9622039794922
      ],
      "text": "If a prequalification assessment procedure is available, manufacturers may proceed directly",
