      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        172.81719970703125,
        526.9630737304688,
        185.9622039794922
      ],
      "text": "If a prequalification assessment procedure is not yet available, an evidence review will be",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        188.31719970703125,
        526.9862670898438,
        201.4622039794922
      ],
      "text": "conducted through a WHO/GTB evidence assessment process, facilitated by the Technical",
