      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        203.81719970703125,
        526.9063720703125,
        216.9622039794922
      ],
      "text": "Advisory Group on TB Diagnostics and Laboratory Strengthening. If recommended by",
