      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        234.81719970703125,
        526.96533203125,
        247.9622039794922
      ],
      "text": "The recommendation will stand until the prequalification assessment procedure becomes",
